{"id":"n62322-2-7","stage":2,"title":"물다 · 闭","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62322-2-7-1","ko":"치료가 좀 아팠지?","zh":"治疗的时候有点疼吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"치료가","meaning":"治疗","explanation":"치료：治疗；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"치료","audio":"/audio/6f44a9c1f36d86e996c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83170","senseId":"1","lemma":"치료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아팠지?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f44a9c1f36d86e9","term":"치료","zh":"治疗","audio":"/audio/6f44a9c1f36d86e996c7.mp3","entryId":"83170","definition":"治愈疾病或伤口等。","pronunciation":["치료"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/085a186eda91f55816dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62322-2-7-2","ko":"네, 그래도 이를 꽉 물고 참았어요.","zh":"是的，不过我还是咬紧牙关忍住了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"尽管如此、不过还是","explanation":"그래도：尽管如此、不过还是","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseI